{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30974","headline":"国学试风化下 · 薛能","name":"国学试风化下","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霁阙露穹崇，含生仰圣聪。\n英明高比日，声敎下如风。\n静发宸居内，低来品物中。\n南薰歌自溥，北极响皆通。\n苹末看无状，人间觉有功。\n因今委泥者，覩此忘途穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30974.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30974","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}